CHAPTER.VERS:
Hear my words, you

          {+}
         wise men; And give ear to me, you

          {+}
         who have knowledge.

Therefore listen to me, you

          {+}
         men of understanding: Far be it from God, that he should do wickedness, And from the Almighty, that he should commit iniquity.

[Him] who says to a king, [You are] vile, [Or] to nobles, [You

          {+}
         are] wicked;
